---
description: Mini CMS project-wide rules
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

- Use Nuxt 4 in `apps/frontend` and Strapi 5 in `apps/backend`.
- Follow `docs/CODING_STANDARDS.md` and `docs/RULES.md`.
- Install frameworks and libraries through official tools; do not recreate framework files manually when a generator/package exists.
- Keep `docs/TASKS.md` updated from `[ ]` to `[*]` after completed work.
- Keep `docs/prompts.md` updated after important AI-assisted steps.
- Do not commit secrets, `.env`, build output, caches or `node_modules`.
- Work through branches and PRs; do not push directly to `main`.
